```

### Insights
In contrast to `createForks` (which defaults to a `${baseBucket}-fork-${timestamp}` prefix), `createWorkspace` remains transparent with naming, allowing the caller to have full control over the bucket name. If you require prefixing, it must be handled by the caller before passing the name to `createWorkspace`.

